OL,3,AUK-US alliance is closest of any two
OL,4,Anations on Earth, Streeting tells
OL,5,ALabour conference
OL,6,
OL,7,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting tells
OL,8,FLabour's conference that the UK's
OL,9,F"friendship with America is the closest
OL,10,Falliance of any two nations on Earth"
OL,12,FSpeaking about the RAF Fairford
OL,13,Fcounter-terror probe, he says "what we
OL,14,Fsaw yesterday from our security
OL,15,Fservices, our armed forces and our
OL,16,Fpolice was just a small glimpse of the
OL,17,Fextraordinary work they do everyday"
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
